{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21561","headline":"赠咸阳少府萧郎 · 元稹","name":"赠咸阳少府萧郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫怪逢君泪每盈，仲由多感有深情。\n陆家幼女托良壻，阮氏诸房无外生。\n顾我自伤爲弟拙，念渠能继事姑名。\n别时何处最肠断，日暮渭阳驱马行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}